1	SIMPLE	t2	#	eq_ref	PRIMARY	#	#	#	#	#	Child of 't1' in pushed join@1
1	SIMPLE	t3	#	eq_ref	PRIMARY	#	#	#	#	#	Child of 't1' in pushed join@1
Note	1003	/* select#1 */ select `test`.`t1`.`grp` AS `grp`,sum(`test`.`t3`.`amount`) AS `SUM(t3.amount)`,count(0) AS `COUNT(*)` from `test`.`t1` join `test`.`t2` join `test`.`t3` where ((`test`.`t2`.`pk` = `test`.`t1`.`pk`) and (`test`.`t3`.`pk` = `test`.`t1`.`pk`)) group by `test`.`t1`.`grp`
Warnings:
